{"bangumi":{"date":"2006-10-05","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/da/8c/793_3y432.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/da/8c/793_3y432.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/da/8c/793_3y432.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/da/8c/793_3y432.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/da/8c/793_3y432.jpg"},"summary":"2010年，超级大国“布里塔尼亚帝国”（Britannia）为了夺取日本的地下资源而侵略日本，在布里塔尼亚帝国强大的兵器Knightmare进攻下，日本在不到一个月的时间内被征服。日本被剥夺了自由、权利甚至是国家的名字，布里塔尼亚帝国将“日本”改称为“11区”，“日本人”这名词则被11这数字所取代。表面上看来布里塔尼亚帝国的统治似乎牢不可破，但其中早已出现了裂痕。\r\n七年后的2017年，在生死边缘获得“Geass”的力量，立志要粉碎布里塔尼亚帝国的黑色皇子鲁路修，以及获得第七世代人型机甲兰斯洛特，立志从帝国内部进行改革的白色骑士枢木朱雀，影响了整个世界。","name":"コードギアス 反逆のルルーシュ","name_cn":"Code Geass 反叛的鲁路修","tags":[{"name":"鲁鲁修","count":4311,"total_count":5497},{"name":"SUNRISE","count":2713,"total_count":92694},{"name":"コードギアス反逆のルルーシュ","count":2189,"total_count":2346},{"name":"TV","count":1828,"total_count":1411490},{"name":"福山润","count":1786,"total_count":15117},{"name":"原创","count":1635,"total_count":623696},{"name":"codegeass","count":1604,"total_count":2857},{"name":"2006","count":1348,"total_count":34387},{"name":"CC","count":1210,"total_count":1347},{"name":"妹控","count":991,"total_count":18516},{"name":"机战","count":967,"total_count":50599},{"name":"一个极端的妹控","count":919,"total_count":935},{"name":"谷口悟朗","count":857,"total_count":6115},{"name":"战斗","count":712,"total_count":475185},{"name":"死妹控","count":475,"total_count":1146},{"name":"2006年10月","count":462,"total_count":3000},{"name":"大河内一楼","count":403,"total_count":17424},{"name":"萝卜","count":295,"total_count":52770},{"name":"科幻","count":268,"total_count":254287},{"name":"日本","count":256,"total_count":300696},{"name":"智斗","count":168,"total_count":23167},{"name":"神作","count":167,"total_count":48031},{"name":"露露羞","count":157,"total_count":163},{"name":"战争","count":130,"total_count":21781},{"name":"CLAMP","count":113,"total_count":17928},{"name":"反逆のルルーシュ","count":106,"total_count":